    <briefdescription>
<para>This file contains the ML-KEM (FIPS 203) client function prototypes for the ASU ML-KEM module. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The client APIs marshal the request parameters into an IPI command and forward it to ASUFW; the actual encapsulation and decapsulation are performed by the ASUFW ML-KEM module. Key pair generation is not an ML-KEM module command: it is requested through the key manager, using XAsu_KmGenerateMlkemKeyPair.</para><para><preformatted>
MODIFICATION HISTORY:</preformatted></para><para><preformatted>Ver   Who  Date     Changes
